    "chunk_text": ", Ic eom Gabriel, ic \u00fee stande beforan Gode, & ic eom asend wi\u00f0 \u00fee And nu \u00feu byst suwiende, & \u00feu sprecan ne miht, o\u00f0 \u00feone d\u00e6g \u00fee \u00f0as \u00f0ing gewur\u00f0a\u00fe, for\u00feam \u00feu And \u00fe\u00e6t folc w\u00e6s Zachariam geanbidiende & wundrodon \u00fe\u00e6t he on \u00feam temple l\u00e6t w\u00e6s. \u00d0a he uteode ne mihte he him to sprecan, & hig oncneowon \u00fe\u00e6t he on \u00feam temple sume gesiht\u00f0e \u00d0a w\u00e6s geworden \u00fea his \u00feenunga dagas gefyllede w\u00e6ron, he ferde to his huse. So\u00f0lice \u00e6fter dagum Elizabeth his wif geeacnode & heo bediglude hig fif mon\u00feas & cw\u00e6\u00f0, So\u00f0lice So\u00felice on \u00feam syxtan mon\u00f0e w\u00e6s asend Gabriel se engel fram Drihtne on Galilea ceastre, \u00fe\u00e6re \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se engel ingangende, hal wes \u00f0u mid gyfe gefylled, Drihten mid \u00fee; \u00f0u eart gebletsud on \u00dea wear\u00f0 heo on his spr\u00e6ce gedrefed, & \u00feohte hw\u00e6t seo greting w\u00e6re. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se engel, ne ondr\u00e6d \u00feu \u00f0e Maria; So\u00f0lice \u00feu gyfe mid gode gemettest. So\u00f0lice nu \u00feu on inno\u00f0e geeacnast, & sunu censt & his naman H\u00e6lend genemnest. Se by\u00f0 m\u00e6re & \u00fe\u00e6s hehstan sunu genemned, & him syl\u00fe Drihten God his f\u00e6der, Dauides setl, & he \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Maria to \u00feam engle: hu gewyr\u00f0 \u00feis for\u00f0am ic were ne oncnawe? \u00d0a andswarode hyre se engel; Se halga gast on \u00fe",
